    <comment>Stretch exercise name</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Stretch_OverheadReach_Area" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>上背</value>
    <comment>Body area, shown under the exercise</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Stretch_OverheadReach_Instruction" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>雙手十指交扣，向上高舉，緩慢呼吸。接著放下手臂，讓肩膀放鬆。</value>
