  </data>
  <data name="Stretch_ShoulderShrug_Instruction" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>雙肩往耳朵方向抬起，停留片刻，再放鬆落下。重複幾次。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Stretch_NeckRoll_Name" xml:space="preserve">
